  the metadata in this file.
title: Plexa
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-08-02
authors:
  - family-names: Guinn-Bailey
    given-names: Kellan
abstract: >-
  Open-source, modular platform for instructor-authored,
  AI-supported lessons that develop general and domain-specific AI literacy in higher education.
  It provides institutionally deployable student
  and instructor portals, a server-authoritative lesson runtime, and
  OpenAI-compatible inference integration.
